    "description": "B.tech lo second class ochina brain tho chepthuna, suicide kanna dharidramaindhi edaina undhi ante adhi ninnu nuvve nimmakai baddha la nakipoye alochanalatho nalipesukovatame. Dhinne English lo self-pity or self-deprecating behaviour antaru. \n\nKukkalaki, nakkalaki ee symptoms untayo emo telidhu kaani manishi ga puttina prathi vaadiki edho oka phase lo aakalitho paatu, ilanti adukkuthine alochanalu osthu untai, srusti rahasyam idhi. Ikada manam realise avvani aaratam enti ante, bagupadataniki kanna badhapadataniki alochinchesthuntaam. \n\nAla ani neetho nuvu kurchoni matladukoku anatledhu. Maatladuko, manchidhe! Kani nidrapattakunda raatrantha jaagaram chesentha kotladukoku. Trending lo leni baggy pant esukoni thiriginatte untundi, chuddtaaniki bagodhu. \n\nGeneral audience la matladukunte matram, naku telisi jeevitham lo sagam dhaarunalu, dharidraalu kurchoni matladukunte set ipothai. ‘Anthe antava?’ ani adigithe.. Kurchoni matladukunte deshaale kalisipothunai, bodi nuvu, nenu, mana chuttu unde ee janalu entha? Goru lo irrikkupoyina matt’antha. Okka rendu vaaralu, jarigipoyina vishyalu chusi edavakunda, jaragalsina vishyalu chusi jadavakunda - neetho nuvu nilapadu. Nanna ki ela cheppali, nachina pani ela chesukovali ane full HD clarity rakapoyina, atleast ela solve cheyachu ane vithanalu maatram basic ga yesukuntav. \n\nBtw cancer ki cure unattu inferiority complex ki kuda yedho okati unde undali but nenu antha chaduvkoledhu kabatti, telisina naatu vaidhyame chepthe - ‘Neetho nuvu siggulekunda untu, nuvvento nuvu telusukuntu unte chaalu. Nee meedha neekantu oka clarity edicheka, Ilanti budagalu oodukune alochanlu raavu, undavu’. Na page unfollow ipoyina na crush meedha ottu. \n\nP.S 1: Suicide ani comparison kosam vaadalsi ochindhi thappa, pedha nakkuda parichyam ledhu dhantho. \n\nP.S 2: Ee sodh’antha vaadike cheppachuga lanti vignyana pradarsanlu odhu. Konni vinali, konni telusukovali. \n\nMee Pelli kaani prasadu.\nFM. #fakemuchatlu",
